  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a8253e0b-58ea-4eaa-8da5-eb50245a217d.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 131px;\" /></p><p>The formula of capacitance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/023c29c2-145a-4af0-8e26-98b212ace132.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 221px;\" /></p><p>The dielectric constant of metal sheet is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></math></p><p>The new value of capacitance is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p>Clearly, the ratio,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p></blockquote>",
